05 342.88978 378.3 145 re f Q q .067 .271 .494 rg 205 342.88978 3 145 re f Q q .067 .271 .494 rg 541.3 475.88978 34 13 re f Q q .2 .2 .2 RG .5 w 215 473.88978 m 575.3 473.88978 l S Q q .067 .271 .494 rg 541.3 327.88978 34 13 re f Q q .067 .271 .494 rg 205 257.88978 3 83 re f Q q .2 .2 .2 RG .5 w 215 328.88978 m 575.3 328.88978 l S Q q .067 .271 .494 rg 541.3 242.88977 34 13 re f Q q .067 .271 .494 rg 205 122.88977 3 133 re f Q q .2 .2 .2 RG .5 w 215 243.88977 m 575.3 243.88977 l S Q q .039 .039 .039 rg .067 .271 .494 RG 205 25.98975 378.3 72 re B Q q .2 .2 .2 RG .5 w 215 83.98975 m 575.3 83.98975 l S Q q 157.90622 0 0 78.10004 18.54689 87.18976 cm /Im2 Do Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 205 821.8898 Tm[(RACE WEEKEND DEBRIEF)]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 205 808.3898 Tm[<524F554E4420332020B720204155544F44524F4D45204D4F53542C20435A45434849412020B720203135B73137204D41592032303236>]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 769.8898 Tm[(FREE PRACTICE 1)]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 659.8898 Tm[(SUPERPOLE)]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 548.8898 Tm[(WARM UP 1)]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 476.88978 Tm[(RACE 1  \(+crash\))]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 329.88978 Tm[(WARM UP 2)]TJ ET Q q .067 .271 .494 rg .067 .271 .494 RG BT/hebo 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 244.88977 Tm[(RACE 2)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 553.71377 771.68978 Tm[(P6)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 553.71377 661.68978 Tm[(P8)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 553.71377 551.68978 Tm[(P6)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 551.6287 479.68977 Tm[(P28)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 551.6287 331.68977 Tm[(P20)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 553.71377 246.68978 Tm[(P6)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 757.25228 Tm[(My goal was clear for the start of FP1, get up to speed as quick as we can. Having done a)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 744.6973 Tm[(trackday 2 weeks earlier before our race weekend, it definitely proved useful at such a)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 732.1424 Tm[(challenging track. On my one and only stint, I managed to go a full second quicker than my)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 719.58749 Tm[(time I did here at the test. In a short 20 minute period, and after a few tweaks to the bikes)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 707.0326 Tm[(gearing, we were in a great place for our Superpole session that came ahead of us. I worked)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 694.47769 Tm[(fantastically with my teammate Fenton, we were swapping positions consistently, which really)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 681.9227 Tm[(helped in showing the areas he was stronger than me in, or where I would gain some time.)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 647.25228 Tm[(Our best Superpole session of the year! Super happy with our fast start to the weekend, I only)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 634.6973 Tm[(found a little bit of time compared to our Free practice, but had the potential to go a lot faster.)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 622.1424 Tm[(The plan was the same, I worked with Fenton changing backwards and forwards. We did our)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 609.58749 Tm[(first stint on the scrub tyre, and then swapped for a new. I felt super strong, pushing my own)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 597.0326 Tm[(wind and doing the laps alone, I finished a strong P8 with only 0.7 to the front. Excited to start)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 584.47769 Tm[(from the front of the grid!)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 534.25228 Tm[(We were greeted to a fairly chilly track for our 9:20am warm up. We wanted to try something)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 521.6973 Tm[(different with our rear shock spring to try and gain a better feeling. On top of this, warm up is a)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 509.14244 Tm[(great chance to practice overtaking for our race. Sussing out good overtaking places are. The)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 496.5875 Tm[(changes we made weren't so bad, but I did prefer my previous setting from qualifying.)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 462.25227 Tm[(I felt confident on the grid, starting P8 on the grid after my best qualifying. My goal was clear,)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 449.69737 Tm[(stay confident, get a strong start to stay out of the trouble at turn 1 and get into that front)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 437.14244 Tm[(group. Lights out and away we went, through the first chicane smoothly and blasting up to)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 424.5875 Tm[(turns 4,5&6. I held position well, sticking inside the pack from the get go, then unfortunately)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 412.03257 Tm[(another ride behind me clattered into my rear wheel, and down I went. With the fantastic help)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 399.47764 Tm[(of the Marshalls, I managed to pick the bike back up and finished the race. Getting some good)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 386.92274 Tm[(data for Sunday. I pulled it home in P29 with an extra 4.5kg of gravel in my belly pan!)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 318.00477 Tm[(We tried something different in this session, a big change with the setting. In an attempt for a better)]TJ/helv 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 306.48377 Tm[(feeling, we made a change to the swingarm length and rear shock spring. We tried to make the bike a)]TJ/helv 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 294.9628 Tm[(little more agile, but one of those changes where it just didn't suit how I was riding. I found the bike was)]TJ/helv 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 283.4418 Tm[(very unstable in the faster corners which didn't give me a good feeling. Although this sounds negative,)]TJ/helv 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 271.9208 Tm[(it showed what sort of direction best suits myself and the bike and we swapped back to the previous)]TJ/helv 7.8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 260.3998 Tm[(setting I felt best with.)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 232.25228 Tm[(My best result in World Sportbike to date! A hard fought battle with some fast riders saw us)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 219.69734 Tm[(bring home 10 more world championship points. After a big crash at the start of turn 1, I had to)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 207.14243 Tm[(avoid a 5 rider pile up as we entered the first chicane. Attempting to avoid the chaos, I lost a)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 194.5875 Tm[(few places, but got my head down and pushed hard to close the gap to the riders in front.)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 182.03256 Tm[(Picking off positions as I went, I clawed my way to inside the top 10, and finishing just 3)]TJ/helv 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 169.47765 Tm[(seconds from the win.)]TJ ET Q q .784 1 0 rg .784 1 0 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 86.88977 Tm[<4C4F4F4B494E4720414845414420B720524F554E4420342020B72020415241474F4E>]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 74.28977 Tm[(After what was our strongest weekend yet, I'm looking forward to going to a circuit I know and I)]TJ/helv 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 62.47337 Tm[(enjoy. The team and I had a strong test there earlier this year, where we have good data and a)]TJ/helv 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 50.656969 Tm[(strong sense of setting and gearing as we head into our FP1. With it just being shy of 2 weeks away,)]TJ/helv 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 215 38.84057 Tm[(I'm looking forward to getting back out in my Triumph 660 already!)]TJ ET Q q 1 1 1 rg 1 1 1 RG BT/hebo 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 38.8 186.78977 Tm[(HARRISON DESSOY)]TJ ET Q q .784 1 0 rg .784 1 0 RG BT/hebo 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 59.2 177.18978 Tm[(PHR PERFORMANCE)]TJ ET Q q .784 1 0 rg .784 1 0 RG BT/hebo 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.7155 31.88977 Tm[(P15)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 6.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 37.7 24.089772 Tm[(Championship)]TJ ET Q q .784 1 0 rg .784 1 0 RG BT/hebo 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 118.1575 31.88977 Tm[(10 PTS)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 6.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 116.3 24.089772 Tm[(Points Scored)]TJ ET Q q .659 .659 .659 rg .659 .659 .659 RG BT/helv 6.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 205 2.0897706 Tm[<50485220506572666F726D616E63652020B72020576F726C642053706F727462696B65204368616D70696F6E7368697020323032362020B72020436F6E666964656E7469616C2073706F6E736F722064656272696566>]TJ ET Q q .784 1 0 rg .784 1 0 RG BT/hebo 6.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 523.3 2.0897706 Tm[(DessoyRacing.com)]TJ ET Q
